<title>NETHERLANDS: BEGEMANN POSTS DFL 5.5 MLN 1996 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>BEGEMANN POSTS DFL 5.5 MLN 1996 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.5  vs 141.6 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.00 vs   1.00</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (gldrs)     45.77 vs  45.66</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial investment firm Koninklijke Begemann Groep</p>
<p>NV said it was too early to give a forecast for 1997.</p>
<p>The company previously said it expected a slightly positive</p>
<p>net profit in the full-year 1996. It posted a 14.2 million</p>
<p>guilders net profit in the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>    Dividend income		     29.1  vs  15.1</p>
<p>    Interest income			7.3  vs   3.1</p>
<p>Total gains from participations 36.4  vs  18.2</p>
<p>    Total operating costs	     10.0  vs  11.5</p>
<p>    Gross operational profit	  26.4  vs   6.7</p>
<p>    Financial charges		   22.9  vs  30.7</p>
<p>    Net operational profit	     3.5  vs  24.0 loss</p>
<p>    Profits on asset sales	     2.0  vs  35.7</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges		nil  vs 153.3</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
